'''Year's End Event''' (年末特別番組（プログラム）, ''Nenmatsu Tokubetsu Bangumi （Puroguramu） '', '''Year-End Special Show (Program)''') is an event that is held around one week before the New Year begins.

==Event Information==
Time to say bye-bye to another year with The Battle Cats! Limited Years' End events galore!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from December 22nd (11:00am) until December 31st (11:59pm)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Year End Countdown Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Special log-in bonuses to celebrate the end of the year are now available! Login every day to earn prizes including Cat Tickets and Rare Tickets!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from December 25th (12:00am) until December 31st (11:59pm)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Get even MORE Cat Food from the Li'l Cat Scratcher!'''}}<br>
Get one chance for a bonus prize of Cat Food at a special Cat Scratcher lottery event! Choose a circle and reveal your prize!<br>
Event Schedule<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #1: December 22nd (11:00am) until December 31st (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #2: January 1st (11:00am) until January 7th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #3: January 8th (11:00am) until January 16th (10:59am)'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Purchase Cat CPUs to quickly skip battles!'''}}<br>
Cat CPUs and Rare Tickets bundled together in one item pack for purchase!<br>
Use 2 Cat CPUs and Cat Energy to skip previously cleared stages and collect their rewards! Gather up battle rewards quickly with the items in this pack!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Available from December 22nd (11:00am) until December 31st, 2025 (11:59pm)!'''}}<br>
※ The Cat CPU Pack can only be purchased once during the sale period.<br>
※ Skip battle functionality is unlocked after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1 Hawaii.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas Cats Eye Caverns and Grand XP Harvest for a special set of Catseye and XP rewards!<br>
Get as many Catseyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Grand XP Harvest (4 areas)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from December 22nd, 2025 (11:00am) until January 3rd, 2026 (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''・Cats Eye Caverns'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 3rd (11:00am) until January 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#38761D|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#00CCFF|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''12/24, 12/27, 12/30, 1/2, 1/5, 1/8, 1/11, and 1/14!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

